% 1-call-site (1-CFA): a call runs in the context of the place it is
% called from. Sees through one wrapper; an object has no context, so
% each call's own malloc in one function is one object.
callee(I, C1, C2, F, I, none) :- fresh(I, C1, C2, F, _, _).
flow(V, C1, C2, H, none, none) :- new_site(V, H, C1, C2).
